.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK WORK BULK TRANSITION"
.SH NAME
hamstik work bulk transition \- Transition up to 50 work items in one request
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik work bulk transition [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Transition up to 50 work items in one request
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --operations-file
Operations as a JSON array file (path, or - for stdin)
.TP
.B --concurrency
Concurrency mode: require-revision (default) or last-write-wins
Choices: require-revision, last-write-wins
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
